Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.60,0:01:34.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was so desperate that I lost sight of everything but my goal.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.84,0:01:43.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,About your mother's condition...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.58,0:01:50.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If I may, are you her only family?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.15,0:01:52.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My parents are divorced.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.42,0:01:56.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My brother and father both live far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.55,0:02:01.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then please get me in touch with one of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.68,0:02:05.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm the only family that can be here with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have any other relatives?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.71,0:02:15.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, it's just me.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.89,0:02:24.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can be there for her right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.92,0:02:41.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They'll need to do a few more tests to be sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.80,0:02:49.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just gotta wait and see, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.56,0:02:53.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How does your back feel?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's a lot better now.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.33,0:02:57.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The painkillers must be working.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.32,0:03:00.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wonder if it's a hernia.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.70,0:03:04.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I never knew they were supposed to hurt so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.15,0:03:06.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Goodness, what am I to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.63,0:03:19.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine here, so head on home.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.98,0:03:25.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think I'm coming down with a cold, and I wouldn't want to get you sick.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.09,0:03:31.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer couldn't...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.19,0:03:41.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright, I guess I'll go. I need to pick you up some things for your stay, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll go for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.30,0:03:46.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you then.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.45,0:04:00.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your mother has lung cancer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.57,0:04:04.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Her back pain implies that it's also metastasized to her bones.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,From this...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.97,0:04:17.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I was able to act like usual around her.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.76,0:04:35.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hello, Youichi? It's Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.77,0:04:40.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Youichi. It looks like...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.44,0:04:44.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...I may not have much longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.77,0:04:49.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou is trying his hardest to act like nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.88,0:04:57.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll speak to the doctor about it. {kind of hard to tell about this line}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Youichi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Please take care of Kou for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.65,0:05:14.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,From this, the cancer appears to be in its terminal stages.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,To be honest, there is no effective treatment.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.77,0:05:25.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your mother has half a year left, at best.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.67,0:05:29.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Could...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.94,0:05:34.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Could I have saved her if I'd realized it sooner?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wanted to put her mind at ease about the future,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.35,0:05:42.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,so I spent almost all my free time studying
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.99,0:05:47.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,to get into good high schools, colleges, and companies.{please stop doing the thing where your things in a list aren't of the same kind}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.88,0:05:54.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, dinner's ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.47,0:05:59.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not at a good stopping point yet, so eat without me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, again?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.64,0:06:05.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're making Mom lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.85,0:06:08.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.01,0:06:13.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You say that now, but you'll be thanking me once I get my first paycheck.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.00,0:06:18.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not too concerned about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.60,0:06:24.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Eating dinner or watching TV together is a lot more important to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.57,0:06:34.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...made a mistake. {in the general sense, I don't really want to use "wrong" here}{"made a mistake" is one of the acceptable "literal" translations of machigau anyway so what}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.22,0:06:52.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.65,0:06:56.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I was so desperate, I lost sight of everything but my goal.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.53,0:06:59.95,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But that was a mistake.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I should've focused on what was really important.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But it's too late now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No one is available to answer at this time.{one of the actual default voicemail messages in use in the English-speaking world}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.76,0:07:36.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Please leave your name and a short message after the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs30\fscy120\fsp-1\bord0\shad0\c&H3DE8B8&\fnKozuka Gothic Pr6N M\frz356.7\fax-0.86\pos(544.778,351.111)}Tanaka Kouichi
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's your brother...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.52,0:07:44.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, are you there?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just heard from Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.98,0:07:55.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, I'm leaving Mom in your hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm s-sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.75,0:08:29.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka? Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.81,0:08:32.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are we playing cops and robbers?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.81,0:08:36.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, that's a heck of a face she's running over with.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.72,0:08:46.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My neck kills...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs50\bord0\shad0\c&H43413F&\fnCursive Handwriting Tryout\frz343.2\pos(319,247)\b1}You can do it, Kou\NFinish all this and\Nyou'll be OK\NAya
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H43413F&\fnCursive Handwriting Tryout\b1\frz14.32\pos(748.429,133.857)}Don't get stuck doing\Nextra lessons all summer!\NFutaba
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.10,0:09:24.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.54,0:09:28.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What're you spacing out for?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.11,0:09:29.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.49,0:09:33.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We know you don't have work today.{wait, does he even have a job?}{nope}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.96,0:09:37.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That means you can study all we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs36\bord0\shad0\fnFranklin Gothic\fax-0.16\frz9.055\b1\pos(634.175,238.684)\3c&HEFEFEE&\c&HEFEFEE&}Library
