Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.08,0:09:47.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun, what subject do you want to start with?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.34,0:09:56.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll take that to mean that you're open to anything.{lit. I like your dedication to do anything today}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.07,0:09:59.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I brought the latest in my math notes series.
