Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.12,0:10:16.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to the bathroom before we start.{"stop at" is more A->(bathroom)->B movement, whereas this is A->(bathroom)->A (well, what he says, at least)}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, see ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.15,0:10:31.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun's been gone for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.31,0:10:35.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's he doing in there?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.18,0:10:39.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Didn't he just go home?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.07,0:10:40.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.31,0:10:43.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, he's probably just taking a big one.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.27,0:10:45.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So why's his bag gone?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.06,0:10:46.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is it really?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.53,0:10:52.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He tricked us!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.05,0:10:54.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I knew he was a brat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.83,0:11:01.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If we leave now, we can still catch him!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ah, sor—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.47,0:11:09.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry abou—
