Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.67,0:11:19.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.65,0:11:21.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.31,0:11:25.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What an unfortunate accident.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.57,0:11:31.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A bit {\i1}too{\i0} unfortunate.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.58,0:11:35.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Damn, he got away.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.65,0:11:40.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He seemed really out of it today.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there was something strange about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.97,0:11:46.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can't figure the guy out.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.26,0:11:50.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't you get the feeling he's keeping something big to himself?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.64,0:11:58.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought we were getting closer to him, he pushes us away again.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's just like a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sounds about right.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.46,0:12:09.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He probably doesn't even know what he wants. He's not the brightest.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't help but like him.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.04,0:12:18.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna drag him around all summer vacation.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'd love for us all to go somewhere together.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.26,0:12:24.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Like the movies, or an amusement park...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.34,0:12:28.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh! We could go hiking again like during the leadership course!{was this always capitalized?}{no, fixed}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.87,0:12:31.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure, as long as we don't get lost again.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, well... that time, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.64,0:12:39.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou, we're all waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.70,0:12:45.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's a bright and cheerful world right outside your door.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why won't you come out?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Come out! Get out here, Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,We're all waiting!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tanaka-sensei.{I like his shirt}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Kou, he's not back yet. {Kou isn't back yet}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.47,0:13:11.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sensei, Kou-kun won't open the door to his heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.89,0:13:15.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He keeps opening all these other doors to me,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.03,0:13:20.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but the one I really want opened is locked tight.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.44,0:13:23.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Behind a double lock, even.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.27,0:13:29.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is that so? I think you're a bit off, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.87,0:13:33.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If we're going to go with your metaphor,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.23,0:13:38.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,it's more like he didn't even give the door a doorknob, never mind a lock.
