Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.14,0:13:45.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sensei, what should I do now?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.48,0:13:48.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan doesn't have a clue either.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just have to smash that door to pieces!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That damn brat!
