Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.54,0:14:04.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Just like how Kou opened the door to my heart, I can open his!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's like a storm.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.01,0:14:28.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, it's time to come out.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Open your door.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.55,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's here! He's really here!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.13,0:15:10.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know what they did next?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.39,0:15:18.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If you want someone to talk with, then I'm right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.81,0:15:24.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,A-And Kominato-kun and Yuuri are, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.31,0:15:25.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.98,0:15:27.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.61,0:15:31.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are we too boring for you or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.74,0:15:37.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nah, don't worry. That's just what Kou's like.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's always like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.46,0:15:44.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Actually, you haven't been around much lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.17,0:15:47.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Got something nice in your life?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.22,0:15:57.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.52,0:16:13.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Again she comes running, with that dumb look on her face.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.62,0:16:24.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I told you not to go there by yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.88,0:16:32.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, how long are you going to keep this up?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Keep what up?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.93,0:16:40.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Keep everything up! Everything you're doing right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.78,0:16:59.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it tire you out?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.91,0:17:02.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's the point of it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There is no point.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.30,0:17:14.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing I do has a point.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.09,0:17:18.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You probably can't understand with your "start over from step one" attitude.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.18,0:17:22.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know that...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.35,0:17:26.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But if she saw you like this,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.06,0:17:30.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your mother would be sad—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You don't need to tell me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The thought of it tortures me day and night.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.78,0:17:41.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But that kind of thinking won't solve anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.33,0:17:48.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Even if I realized all the mistakes I've made, I can't do it over.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.96,0:17:55.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I watched my mother grow thinner by the day
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.42,0:17:59.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,as she resigned herself to her fate.{I think you misinterpreted this line -- it's part of the same sentence as the next two lines. These two lines are "At the side of my mother, who acted as though she were preparing for death as she grew thinner by the day"}{I know, but I tried to get around it}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.64,0:18:04.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What I felt back then... {I'd like to swap these lines but they're just too long}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.81,0:18:11.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...you will never understand.{this is a perfectly acceptable sentence}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.52,0:18:17.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But you know, sometimes things just don't go your way.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.40,0:18:20.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's when you go back to step one.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.25,0:18:35.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou is suffering as much now as he did then.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.88,0:18:41.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No one but Kou himself will ever fully understand his feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.85,0:18:44.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I try,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.72,0:18:47.10,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,it'll never be enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.98,0:18:52.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I want to understand you with all of my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is that really so wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I just want to smash it to pieces.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.33,0:19:14.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to smash that damned door to bits!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.76,0:19:21.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.89,0:19:30.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to hard to break in? {UGH}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not just you. Everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.49,0:19:42.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm scared of that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.45,0:19:46.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Sto—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Th-That was terrifying.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She's heavy...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.05,0:20:03.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.35,0:20:11.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you feel scared, then that means you already see us as precious!{next episode previews are not binding}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.60,0:20:15.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're scared to lose us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.07,0:20:21.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You really know how to be annoying.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.32,0:20:27.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you've lost so much already that no one thing can ever replace it,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.24,0:20:30.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,you just have to grab as much as you can.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.83,0:20:36.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They might be so small that it takes tens or hundreds of them, but when you've found enough...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.46,0:20:42.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...you'll finally want to live again!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.97,0:20:49.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly fine to get too into something or to laugh like an idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.89,0:20:53.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And if anyone says otherwise, I'll beat them up!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.45,0:21:09.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Oh... she's right...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All I wanted...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.41,0:21:16.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...was to be able to live and laugh freely.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.25,0:21:20.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Someone to tell me it was okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...to have meaning in my life.{I think these four lines might want their timing widened | also, these lines were more like "I wanted, were I to enjoy life, to be forgiven"}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.69,0:21:43.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I really have been...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.65,0:21:49.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...waiting for a storm like her to come.
